---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Rutes 2026 — Trail de Sora (11K i 21K)">
  <section class="bg-[#181a18] text-white py-14 sm:py-20 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl sm:text-7xl tracking-wider text-[#fca52a]">rutes</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/85">
        Aquí podeu accedir a les dues rutes d'aquest 16 de maig: <strong class="text-white">A gaudir-les!</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#f6f7f4]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
        <!-- Route 1: La Curta 11K -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md border border-neutral-200/80 flex flex-col items-center">
          <a
            href="/images/rutes/curta-11k.png"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl group"
          >
            <img
              src="/images/rutes/curta-11k.png"
              alt="Ruta La Curta 11K - Trail de Sora"
              fetchpriority="high"
              width="1024"
              height="1024"
              class="w-full h-auto object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <span class="inline-block px-8 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#181a18] text-[#fca52a] font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-wider">
              LA CURTA 11K
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Route 2: La Llarga 21K -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md border border-neutral-200/80 flex flex-col items-center">
          <a
            href="/images/rutes/llarga-21k.png"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl group"
          >
            <img
              src="/images/rutes/llarga-21k.png"
              alt="Ruta La Llarga 21K - Trail de Sora"
              width="1024"
              height="1024"
              class="w-full h-auto object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <span class="inline-block px-8 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#181a18] text-[#fca52a] font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-wider">
              LA LLARGA 21K
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Participants CTA -->
      <div class="mt-14 text-center">
        <a
          href="https://www.rockthesport.com/ca/esdeveniment/trail-de-sora-2026/llistat-participants"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-[#fca52a] hover:bg-[#e89218] text-neutral-950 font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-wider shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          CLICA AQUÍ SI VOLS <strong>VEURE LA LLISTA DE VALENTS I VALENTES</strong> QUE SUARAN A SORA
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
